WEBVTT

00:07:03.043 --> 00:07:05.421
So the next time somebody tells you...

00:07:05.421 --> 00:07:09.091
Oh, wait, that doesn't make sense.

00:07:09.758 --> 00:07:11.010
How do I get out of here?

00:07:12.219 --> 00:07:13.721
OK, I can figure this out.

00:07:13.762 --> 00:07:16.015
If that's not a box,

00:07:16.056 --> 00:07:17.892
maybe it's something else entirely.

00:07:22.062 --> 00:07:23.272
Maybe ...

00:07:25.024 --> 00:07:26.358
It's a portal.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:30.237
(Applause and cheers)